  "notes": "{蒸|む}す means to steam (cooking) or to be humid (weather).\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Transitive: ⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒸|む}す (to steam vegetables)\n- Intransitive: ⟦{今日|きょう}→今日：00496_kyou⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧{蒸|む}す (it's humid today)\n\nCOOKING USES:\n- ⟦{野菜|やさい}→野菜：02265_yasai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒸|む}す: to steam vegetables\n- ⟦{肉|にく}→肉：02240_niku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{蒸|む}す: to steam meat\n- {蒸|む}し⟦{料理|りょうり}→料理：01523_ryouri⟧: steamed dishes\n\nWEATHER USES:\n- ⟦{蒸|む}し{暑|あつ}い→蒸し暑い：03751_mushiatsui⟧: hot and humid, muggy\n- {蒸|む}す⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧: a humid/muggy day\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{蒸|む}し{器|き}→蒸し器：08536_mushiki⟧: steamer (cooking tool)\n- ⟦{蒸|む}し{焼|や}き→蒸し焼き：27865_mushiyaki⟧: steam-grilling\n- {蒸|む}し⟦パン→パン：00553_pan⟧: steamed bread/bun\n- ⟦{茶碗蒸|ちゃわんむ}し→茶碗蒸し：17312_chawanmushi⟧: savory egg custard\n- ⟦{蒸気|じょうき}→蒸気：04278_jouki⟧: steam",
